B.FU=new A.h4("Battle of Dunbar (1650)","Fought between Oliver Cromwell's English forces and the Scottish Covenanter army. Despite being outnumbered, Cromwell achieved a decisive victory, leading to the English occupation of southern Scotland. This was a major blow to Scottish independence during the Wars of the Three Kingdoms.")
B.FV=new A.h4("Battle of Killiecrankie (1689)","A dramatic Highland battle where Jacobite forces, loyal to the exiled King James VII, defeated a government army in a fierce charge through the Pass of Killiecrankie. Despite their victory, the Jacobite commander Viscount Dundee was killed, and the rising soon lost momentum.")
B.FY=new A.h4("Battle of Prestonpans (1745)","The first major battle of the 1745 Jacobite Rising, fought just east of Edinburgh. Bonnie Prince Charlie's Highland army routed the government forces in less than fifteen minutes, in one of the most stunning victories in Scottish military history.")
B.KG=new A.bl(B.L6,[B.FU,B.FV,B.FY],t.EM)
